{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14943","headline":"九日奉陪侍中宴後亭 · 卢纶","name":"九日奉陪侍中宴後亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉壶倾菊酒，一顾得淹留。\n彩笔徵枚叟，花筵舞莫愁。\n管弦能驻景，松桂不停秋。\n爲谢蓬蒿辈，如何霜霰稠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14943.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14943","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}